# ===== Vendor SDK / real-project fixtures (E-003: license, never committed) =====
# Chip-vendor SDKs and private real-project demos stay LOCAL ONLY as reference
# material. They live on disk under docs/vendors/ for local sim/test but are
# never redistributed. CMake fixture-gates the tests that consume them and
# gracefully skips on a fresh clone/CI where they are absent.
docs/vendors/

